KOREAN TRANSLATION AND EDITORIAL APPARATUS
==========================================

To the extent that the Interlanguage project holds rights in the Korean
translation, Korean typesetting, project-authored metadata, indexes, decision
records, and QA evidence in this repository, those materials are licensed
under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Project contribution: "AI typesetting & translation."

UNDERLYING WORK AND SOURCE EDITION
==================================

The underlying mathematical work is by Alexander Grothendieck and Jean
Dieudonné. The historical French edition and third-party bibliographic
material retain their own rights and attribution. This file does not purport
to relicense rights that the Interlanguage project does not hold. The release
includes Korean editable source and exact identifiers/hashes for the French
authority; it does not bundle the complete French authority file.
